# The image holds only what the running app reads (R77). Everything is left out first, then each needed path is let
# back in. Never let in .env (keys, including the test-run key), data/testset, data/split.json (the held-out split),
# the test-run results or the live databases. Of data/results/final only the summaries the Results tab reads go in,
# never the held-out conversations (attempts, verdicts, ungraded files) or the run's databases.
*

!requirements.txt
!scripts/entrypoint.sh
!app
!data/index
!data/kb_text
!data/document_list.csv
!data/results/final/summary.json
!data/results/final/run_summary.json
!data/results/final/per_driver.json
!data/results/final/consistency/summary.json
!call_data/knowledge_base
!call_data/scheduling_db/meridian_scheduling.sqlite
!docs/FINDINGS.md

# Left out even inside the folders let in above.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/*:Zone.Identifier
